The invariant is now fixed: at any loop head, the eventual returned integer is the current accumulator plus a recursive summary of the unconsumed character codes and the remembered last character. Its base case contributes only terminal `y/Y`; its step contributes exactly the fixed-semantics substring-membership result. The summary is definitional and replaces no execution.
